ory Library Program (FDLP).  aPresentation.  aIncludes bibliographical references.  aPublicly released3 aThis presentation gives an overview of Pumped Thermal Energy Storage (PTES), and in particular concentrates on the performance and cost of a Joule-Brayton cycle with liquid storage. Results for systems with supercritical CO2 are also presented. PTES may be hybridized with solar heat, and some examples are provided as well as an overview of potential issues.  aU.S. Department of Energy (DOE)bDE-AC36-08GO28308  aDescription based on online resource; title from PDF title page (NREL, viewed November 17, 2025). 0aHeat storage. 0aCarnot cyclexBatteries. 0aSolar thermal energy.1 aFarres-Antunez, Pau,eauthor.1 aWhite, Alexc(Of University of Cambridge),eauthor.2 aNational Renewable Energy Laboratory (U.S.),eissuing body. 0aNREL/PR ;v5700-78432.40uhttps://purl.fdlp.gov/GPO/gpo249310704 zAddress at time of PURL creationuhttps://www.nrel.gov/docs/fy21osti/78432.pdf  aC0bGPO  aDOCDISCOVERYb20260409  abc107 20260608  abc107 20260409b2026040903526cas a2200637 i 00147104420260618111625.0m     o  d f      cr |||||||||||260414c20uu9999mduar   o    f0    0eng c  a2026228589  a(OCoLC)1584665766  aGPObengerdaepncGPOdGPO  apcc  an-us---  aGPOO  a0507 (online)0 aHE 20.3002:SM 1/2 aNational Institutes of Health (U.S.),eauthor.0http://id.loc.gov/authorities/names/n7808544510aFY ... annual report Health and Human Services due diligence administrative costs reporting.1 aSBIR due diligence FY ...1 aNational Institutes of Health (NIH) Small Business Innovation Research (SBIR) and Small Business Technology Transfer Research (STTR) report administrative costs annual report FY ... 1aBethesda, Maryland :bDepartment of Health & Human Services, Public Health Service, National Institutes of Health  a1 online resource (volumes)  aAnnual  atextbtxt2rdacontent  acomputerbc2rdamedia  aonline resourc