aBlogs have no number designations.  a"The Signal" is meant to elicit two images. The name sounds a bit like a town newspaper, one that has timely information that people can put to practical use. That is our basic intent-discuss digital stewardship in a way that is informative and appealing. "Signal" also associates with computer technology, most especially management, transmission and use of data. Technology is moving fast, and we cover exciting new developments that have an impact on digital preservation and access.0 aMay 31, 2011; title from blogs home page caption (LC, viewed June 11, 2026).1 aJune 10, 2026 (LC, viewed June 11, 2026). 0aDigital preservationzUnited StatesvBlogs. 7aBlogs.2fast0(OCoLC)fst016928252 aLibrary of Congress,epublisher.0http://id.loc.gov/authorities/names/n7808903540uhttps://purl.fdlp.gov/GPO/gpo257124704 zAddress at time of PURL creationuhttps://blogs.loc.gov/thesignal/  aC0bGPO  abc103 20260611b20260611  aCONSERNEWb20260611  aUNREPORTEDPUBSASKGPOb20260611  aVEND01b2026062402842cam a2200565 i 00147466520260617122447.0m     o  d f      cr |||||||||||210312e202011uudcua    obt  f000 0 eng c  a(OCoLC)1241261091  aELCbengerdaepncELCdOCLCOdOCLCQdOCLCOdOCLCLdGPO  apcc  an-us---  aXZL4  a0484-E (online)0 aEP 6.52:G 82/4  aEPA-420-R-20-01500aGreenhouse gas and energy consumption rates for onroad vehicles in MOVES3 /cAssessment and Standards Division, Office of Transportation and Air Quality, U.S. Environmental Protection Agency. 1a[Washington, DC] :bAssessment and Standards Division, Office of Transportation and Air Quality. United States Environmental Protection Agency,cNovember 2020.  a1 online resource (32 pages) :bcolor illustrations  atextbtxt2rdacontent  acomputerbc2rdamedia  aonline resourcebcr2rdacarrier  a"EPA-420-R-20-015."  a"November 2020."  aSupersedes EPA 420-R-15-003.  aThis is a publication issued by the United States federal gov